Maintainer: HyperWhisper Contributors <opensource@hyperwhisper.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: hyperwhisper (= @VERSION@), libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libgomp1
Replaces: hyperwhisper (<< @VERSION@)
Breaks: hyperwhisper (<< @VERSION@)
Homepage: https://hyperwhisper.com
Description: NVIDIA CUDA 12 backends for HyperWhisper
 Optional GPU backends that let HyperWhisper run local Whisper transcription
 and local LLM post-processing on an NVIDIA GPU through CUDA 12. They need the
 NVIDIA driver and the CUDA 12 runtime libraries. Without this package,
 HyperWhisper uses its Vulkan or CPU backends.
